        "created_at": "2014-10-20T18:00:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you’re looking at home rules for this kind of thing (which would probably be fun, if a little broken  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> ), check out elevation tools like <a href=\"http://paizo.com/search?q=combat+tiers&amp;what=all&amp;includeUnrated=true&amp;includeUnavailable=true\">Combat Tiers </a>or <a href=\"http://paizo.com/search?q=elevation+indicator&amp;what=all&amp;includeUnrated=true&amp;includeUnavailable=true\">Dr. Wizard’s Elevation Indicator</a>, or even <a href=\"http://www.aleatools.com/\">Alea Tools</a>, as they also work well for this kind of thing.</p>",
