        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-20T20:23:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Did you let Legacy attack? &nbsp;Because flying at elevation 20 would ruin his atttacks as well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Making flying work in that way would require a whole lot of rules being added, and unbalance the game quite a bit.</p><p>Visionary could make her teameffectively invincible by floating everyone too high to be attacked.</p>",
