        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/df788c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-20T21:29:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was using the flying smash…well…the plan was to fly high and land in a central space in which i could potentially finish 3 different blade inventions…flying was the only way to get there witout triggering the spaces since mobility let you move without taking into account changes in elevetion, meaning Legacy can move from elevation 20 to floor without any problem…o so we thought… <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
